---
description: Rules for ViewModel layer with Riverpod
globs: lib/*/application/viewmodel/**/*.dart
alwaysApply: false
---

# ViewModel

- One ViewModel per file.
- ViewModel communicates only with domain layer (use cases/services).
- Never import data layer or Firebase-specific code.
- Try to use the loading, error and success state of riverpod for the UI where is possible.